==Description==
The '''Hip Lamp''' is an equip-able item that provides a light aura around the player. It is a hands-free device, unlike the [[Torch]], which allows the player to interact with other tools while keeping the light source. The light can be toggled with {{key|Y}}. The lantern will break after being used for a unknown length of time. It will '''not''' drop on death.

